 ## 5.2
 
+### Added
+
+- New web service `mod_forum_set_read_state` (`\mod_forum\external\set_read_state`) to set the read state of a forum post when manual read marking (`forum_usermarksread`) is enabled.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-87887](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87887)
+
 ### Deprecated
 
 - The forum report entity `->get_context_joins()` method is deprecated, replaced with `->get_course_modules_joins(...)`
